{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":758204,\"title\":\"Sergeant\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"One night in Belgrade, a young guy meets a man for casual sex. By morning, different expectations can bring a new light on this chance meeting.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3zzsG5sLgLe9UJT68fU0F0QVR2o.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vTWepQ4Futf75np3wc2arqIG8dn.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":21,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"RS\",\"name\":\"Serbia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Nikola Ljuca\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1579323,\"name\":\"Nikola Ljuca\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1345553,\"name\":\"Jasmina Avramović\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vKRdmNbWWG6IYRSZ4LKBwTAPsGS.jpg\"},{\"id\":558031,\"name\":\"Milan Marić\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hhHFNtoyDFnOjh0w8lrTlvrVZBg.jpg\"},{\"id\":938096,\"name\":\"Miloš Timotijević\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cpwpKFgLSl2KmfkWYPsO206Qbmf.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":963765,\"title\":\"Strange Way of Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uKOSFVplHUtvjtDEE5N4x8Hs9vL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8J5GetxLHw6R380GUBEmH95dvrl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After 25 years, a former hired gun visits his old colleague, now a small-town sheriff. Their past relationship is explored, as is how they reflect on it in the present.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":706860,\"title\":\"Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dCmtnJqu4Lk4yzEPoLZkHYrpwaP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/knLH3cYsDt7jO6uSMrc0PXfimra.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On an average day, Greg's life is filled with family, love and a rambunctious little dog - but despite all of this, Greg has a secret. Today is different, though. With some help from his precocious pup, and a little bit of magic, Greg might learn that he has nothing to hide.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4633,\"title\":\"Cutlass\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gjG0b2R157be0k9Vt77oVOZpimI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Robin's daughter Lacy wants to buy an expensive guitar, Robin reminisces about the days when she was a teenager, asking her dad for her first car, an Olds Cutlass Supreme.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5001,\"title\":\"Before Night Falls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kb2dqj73cfmt6qHAh1ySIlVm6v0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jnJ4i6vPQETcfjxOvAODxzsdQfX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spanning several decades, this powerful biopic offers a glimpse into the life of famed Cuban poet and novelist Reinaldo Arenas, an artist who was vilified for his homosexuality in Fidel Castro's Cuba.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4974,\"title\":\"Five Times Two\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sZRa3rg7kKt8qkJ6C480VPmUR6A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ToHe5BbOxhhmTx8txIJLM45ff8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As young French couple Gilles and Marion officially separate, we see, in reverse order, the milestone moments in their relationship: Gilles revealing his unfaithfulness at a tense dinner party; Marion giving birth to their premature son while Gilles is elsewhere; Gilles and Marion's joyous wedding; and, finally, the fateful moment when they meet as acquaintances at an Italian beach resort, and their love affair begins.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843657,\"title\":\"A História Real\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/atoQWKk2OmLsKQwF7Dir5eXtWUO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a hospital that struggles not to close its doors, two children discover their first love.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4676,\"title\":\"Grande école\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/etGBmCDIfXWSFrb4wplSsOxAfSN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbl2m9PcHmmhzQIVpvF2mApxFpM.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paul and Agnes have been going out for quite a while and Agnes is shocked to learn that he'd rather live with two roommates on campus than move in with her. As soon as he meets one of his roommates, Louis-Anault, Paul's behavior changes - he is attracted to Louis without realizing so himself. Agnes, on the other hand, gets quite jealous and offers a bet: Whoever gets to have Louis-Anault first, wins... If she does, Paul will no longer explore his homosexual desires, if he does - she'll walk away. Meanwhile, Paul meets Mecir, a young Arab worker, who shows him there's more to life than elite colleges...\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4635,\"title\":\"The Trap\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9ukTMlBrW9yWH9pCxCrMq4I8aj3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qkpfTjR7rIy6IPERA0EigdLDLCm.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Maggie's friends have planned a surprise birthday party (despite it being a month away). During the party, Maggie realizes there's more to it then that.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843477,\"title\":\"Maybe Someday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5tYmKsfYeNHxWSlKgbAJ8VRsyQO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t14TEuqXNJKaRTNSTHFhtZp1Boi.jpg\",\"rating\":3.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jay, a non-binary 40-something photographer, attempts to move across the country in the midst of separating from her wife. Along the way, she takes a detour to stay with her high school best friend who she used to be secretly in love with, and befriends a lonely gay comedian who adds humor and levity to her life. Memories of the past resurface as Jay searches for the joy and courage she needs to move forward with her next chapter in life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1238122,\"title\":\"First Sign of Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vBGZB9DpRn8xSxzjr4hkyGsxzSK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Megan, a 16-year-old with a hearing impairment, is on her first few days at a mainstream school, where she meets Jake and his group of friends. At first, she seems like an outsider, but Jake tries to break down the communication barrier.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":647465,\"title\":\"Ausência\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wqy5LWq35aNXALeA6dkDmICvwjT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Brazilian short film, directed by Julia Murat.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1045000,\"title\":\"Passerby\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An immigrant love story set on a street corner.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"oexVKmhOhOQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"uPqUh93e9js\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-Denciie5oA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}